    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Christopher Hawkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109478236716503491236/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIFhGBcdhrNGCcGYyZRJQIZHrJxSEZ6Peo9ZM29lj0tRVZrvg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "I would have had better attitude from a sour apple. Went on July 15 at 445 pm and the two girls working barely acknowledged me. When I asked where I could find 5-6 month clothing they didn’t even look at me and just pointed to a section. Upon checkout I tried to say hi and one of the girls just flat out ignored me and the other seemed to just want to get rid of me. Never again.",
        "time": 1752668831,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karina González",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105303044879131096449/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLcwrrKk04Xdt-gtGTxNnAW5nrfTXCpW7YVOaOe7SMVbQl_oQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I recently visited  on Monday past 6 pm expecting it to be open according to the hours posted on their website. Unfortunately, I arrived to find the store closed, despite their website stating they should be open. I hope they update their online information to reflect their actual hours accurately.",
        "time": 1718665294,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "The House Layton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107617890960601194224/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKTb72DX8qILUl-MD14R6Ut-ZaDqyOr8wlHMV4bDzMcT9bMbA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "The cashier was racially charged, once she realized I was Indigenous her whole attitude changed towards me. She was very rude and told me to go back and shop in St-Constant, which is close to Kahnawake. She even assumed that that was where I \"came from\" when in fact it isn't. I am so disappointed. I will no longer be shopping from Carter's. This cannot be tolerated. It's quite a shame, I love this company and this experience really shook me up. It's unacceptable though, no one deserves to be treated with a bias.",
        "time": 1621556737,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Amy Daneker",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118113368919536079120/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWiPm5lmvKybebtEx9F4OgaKCuqW6ppVfLgbiDXc3TPGS_03DryqQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Very nicely organized and well kept. We were offered help as soon as we looked lost. lol. Great experience even though we did not find what we were looking for.",
        "time": 1577725783,
        "translated": false
      },
